143	/// caption tailored to the kind of line. Train blocks call out
144	/// the expected duration; everything else gets a generic
145	/// "evaluating..." marker that still tells the user the demo
146	/// hasn't hung. Saga 33 step 027: a "train 5"-shaped chunk
147	/// gets a chunk-sized caption so the user understands each
148	/// chunk is short and the page will recover between chunks;
149	/// large `train 30`+ blocks keep the long-duration warning.
150	pub(crate) fn running_message(line: &str) -> &'static str {
